ot just theatrical and TV which  are sort of the traditional avenues but  video on demand download to own  downloaded rent and a whole slew of  digital options we kind of have a broad  landscape of things in front of us that  we could do and it's pretty interesting  well thank you the film is Honor Flight  it's by directed by dan hayes produced  by clay Braga free think media the world  premiere is going to be in a gigantic  baseball stadium in milwaukee wisconsin  on august eleventh look for look for  that and get there if you can thanks  guys very much good luck with the  project for recent TV i'm nicholas  you
 

